[h1]Cosmic War[/h1]
[i]The definitive diplomatic warfare, mercenary, and conquest expansion for the Cosmic Series.[/i]

[hr][/hr]

[h2]What is Cosmic War?[/h2]
Bring total war to the galaxy! [b]Cosmic War[/b] turns static NPC empires into aggressive, expanding juggernauts. Watch factions build up War Heat, declare devastating wars, lay siege to fortified sectors, and offer you lucrative contracts to shift the balance of power. Every action you take has diplomatic consequences.

[b]⚠️ REQUIRED DEPENDENCIES:[/b] Cosmic War requires [b]Cosmic Vault[/b], [b]Cosmic Overhaul[/b], and [b]Cosmic Chronicles[/b] to run. Subscribe to all three [b]REQUIRED ITEMS[/b] below to play. (Cosmic Ascendancy adds a few extra lore touches if you also have it installed, but it isn't required.)

[hr][/hr]

[h2]🆕 What's New in v3.4.0[/h2]
[list]
[*]💬 [b]New `/cosmicwarbounties` Command:[/b] Check your active Bounty License and the galaxy's top-paying War Bounties straight from chat, no UI required.
[*]📊 [b]Galactic Politics Tab Rework:[/b] Fixed a header overlap on narrow windows, added a dedicated sortable Bounty column, and put your own License status right in the tab header.
[*]📰 [b]Bounty & Ceasefire News Coverage:[/b] Completing a War Bounty License or striking a real ceasefire between two factions now makes the Galactic News Network.
[*]🐛 [b]Major Bugfix Wave:[/b] Fixed a warbond-purchase crash, broken bounty payouts on first and repeat kills, all 22 War Contracts being unclickable on the bulletin board, a non-functional Physical Siege event, a Shield Jammer that was rolling the wrong odds, and 8 dynamic events that were silently never firing.
[/list]

[hr][/hr]

[h2]Core Features[/h2]
[list]
[*]🔥 [b]Dynamic War Heat & Subspace Tears:[/b] Watch tensions rise. At critical levels, factions detonate experimental Subspace Weapons, tearing open localized Rifts!
[*]🛡️ [b]Frontline Sieges & Dreadnoughts:[/b] Factions dynamically siege enemy territory. Invasions scale to match 100% of the defender's strength, spearheaded by Siege Dreadnoughts with 5x shield multipliers.
[*]⚡ [b]Electronic Warfare & Weather Sieges:[/b] Sieges have a 35% chance (open fleet clashes 15%) to EMP burst all shields to 0 for 10 seconds. Dark Matter Fog during a siege cuts defender boarding resistance in half.
[*]🏰 [b]Planetary Defense Grids:[/b] Sectors with Planetary Shields render every station invincible until the shield generator is destroyed.
[*]🌍 [b]Dynamic Territory Expansion:[/b] Factions physically conquer stations with AI Troop Transports and permanently expand their borders on the Galaxy Map.
[*]💰 [b]Mercenary Enlistment & 22 War Contracts:[/b] Take on dynamically scaling combat missions gated by War Heat (Force Recon, Subspace Containment, Supply Line Raid, Decapitation Strike, and more).
[*]🎭 [b]9 Dynamic Faction Traits:[/b] Factions generate with traits like Entrenched or Imperialist, shaping their AI aggression and mercenary payouts.
[*]🤝 [b]Alliance PvP Mirroring:[/b] Diplomatic incidents and civilian-convoy kills spread their reputation consequences to your entire Player Alliance.
[*]📉 [b]Deep Economy Warfare:[/b] Market collapses trigger desperation invasions. Factions with severe Famine Scores launch assaults on wealthy neighbors to survive.
[*]📊 [b]Galactic Politics Tab:[/b] A real-time, sortable ledger of every active AI war, ceasefire, and border skirmish, plus deep espionage tooltips.
[*]🧠 [b]Identity-Driven AI & Bounties:[/b] Factions place bounties on rivals. Mercantile factions pay 3x standard mercenary rates.
[*]📈 [b]Persistent Diplomacy Drift & Sanctions:[/b] Political relationships evolve in the background, and deep rivalries trigger trade sanctions.
[*]🕊️ [b]Ceasefire & Détente:[/b] Conflict cycles de-escalate as factions exhaust themselves - unless they're Vengeful, who will never accept a ceasefire.
[*]📰 [b]War News & Broadcasts:[/b] War bulletins, propaganda beacons, and breaking news updates go out server-wide.
[*]⚙️ [b]Cosmic Overhaul Synergy:[/b] Captain prediction overlays adapt to War Heat, routing fleets around dangerous frontlines.
[/list]

